{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Duty of candour, no second jobs & professional/civic experience for MPs",
        "additional_details": "These reforms are:\r\n1.    Public Office (Accountability) Bill: Amend this legislation to include Members of Parliament within its scope, placing on them the same duty of candour as the Bill proposes to place on other public officials.\r\n2.    Representation of the People Act: Introduce candidate eligibility rules to require at least 5 years of professional or civic leadership (such as volunteering) experience, with background credential claims verified by the Electoral Commission.\r\n3.     Code of Conduct for MPs: Amend House rules via the Parliamentary Standards Act 2009 to legally prohibit paid secondary private sector employment.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to update electoral and standards legislation to enforce three reforms.",
